.. rubric:: Flash partitions on ``4㎆`` revision

+----------------+---------+----------------+-------------------+
| QSPI NOR-Flash | bootrom | code_partition | storage_partition |
+================+=========+================+===================+
| primary 4㎆    |   256B  |    1㎆ - 256B  |         3㎆       |
+----------------+---------+----------------+-------------------+

